WEBVTT

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.350
<i>Episode 14</i>

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:46.730
<i>I must have misheard him...</i>

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.020
You are not Qian Yunshang.

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:53.660
You are the Grand Councilor's first daughter, 
regarded as a jinx and abandoned at a young age.

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:55.970
Qian Yunxi.

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:03.300
Do you dare to respond to me?

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:06.580
I don't fear you. You have no calabash.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.100
Please leave. I need to rest.

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:12.640
You think denial will save you...

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:15.460
but I have evidence.

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:17.430
Evidence?

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:22.180
If I were to thoroughly investigate and 
present my findings to His Imperial Majesty...

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:25.100
What do you want, exactly?

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:28.580
So you remain loyal to your father
despite how he treats you.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:30.470
Blood really is thicker than water.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.600
Stop with this nonsense.

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:36.750
Since you came here on purpose to tell me 
you know, you're not planning on exposing me.

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:39.330
What do you want me to do? Just tell me.

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:43.870
Come to the Hall of Esteemed Virtue every day,

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:47.990
and serve me willingly, rain or shine.

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:50.950
Th-That's all you want?

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:53.410
You don't have any ulterior motives, do you?

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:56.400
Keeping it simple makes it 
easier for both of us to accept.

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:00.320
Dammit!

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:04.110
My lady, please calm down.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:05.810
Isn't it just taking care of him? 
What's the point in getting so angry?

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:09.350
You're not the one who has to serve him!
You say that 'cause you don't have to.

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:13.040
Who'd dare ask <i>me</i> to serve them?!
I'd smash everything in their house!

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:15.600
We'd see if they still 
wanted me to serve them!

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:28.430
Hall of Esteemed Virtue

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.870
This is His Highness' collection.

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:37.430
Please clean it with care, Your Highness.

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:41.930
So this is his precious collection?

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:44.780
Relax and leave it to me.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:56.430
What happened?

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:03.180
I was giving it a little clean, 
and it... it just shattered.

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:06.430
<i>Still want me to serve you?</i>

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:08.370
As long as you are unharmed, dear wife.

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:11.070
It is only a vase. If one shatters, 
we will buy another.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:15.930
<i>Then, you'll be rebuying plenty!</i>

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:22.730
Highness, please wash
these robes for His Highness.

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:25.600
No problem.

00:04:56.220 --> 00:04:57.790
Your Highness...

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:00.850
Her Highness has dropped
your new robes in the river.

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:03.720
Her Highness has torn your books.

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:06.240
And your favorite bonsai was...

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:08.600
<i>Surely now, I'll get away from you!</i>

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:12.520
It matters not. Buy, buy, buy.

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:14.080
Yes, Highness.

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:17.930
Dear wife, are you all right?

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:20.930
Me? I-I'm fine...

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:24.140
Then, continue to serve me.

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:26.800
<i>You're not taking me seriously, huh?</i>

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:28.910
<i>Looks like I need to up my game.</i>

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:50.230
Terrifying.

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:53.890
Your Highness, you were only cooking 
some food... How did you set fire to the pot?

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:57.690
I-I probably put too much oil in.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:00.240
I'm so sorry, Aunt Su.

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:08.700
Y-Your Highness...

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:13.770
While Her Highness was cooking, she set 
the pot alight and terrified the cooks.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:16.250
Are you hurt, dear wife?

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:21.270
N-No, but I burned a hole in the pot...

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:26.050
As the kitchen has burned down, we shall 
build a new one. If you are unhurt, all is well.

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:28.840
Go get some rest.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:35.390
<i>I did so much damage on purpose. 
Why isn't he even the least bit angry?</i>

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:40.220
I really do not know what we should 
arrange for the princess to do...

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:44.050
I fear the palace may not 
remain intact if this continues.

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:48.660
My palace is well-stocked with objects.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:51.140
If she enjoys being destructive, 
let her have her way.

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:54.140
Yes, Highness, I understand.

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:03.890
Qian Yunxi

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:02.970
Qian Yunxi...

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:07.390
Do you believe I cannot see 
through your little tricks?

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:13.640
<i>Back in the House of Grand Councilor,
I'd get severely punished for breaking stuff.</i>

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.750
<i>Why does nothing happen in this palace?</i>

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:20.530
<i>I have to figure out a way to make 
him rethink getting me to serve him. </i>

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:25.390
<i>Maybe the stuff I broke 
wasn't valuable enough?</i>

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:44.390
I have purchased a few more 
valuables that I selected personally.

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:47.900
You may use them to continue 
your entertainment, dear wife.

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:51.270
Wh-What do you mean?

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:55.520
No special meaning. If you enjoy this
 kind of entertainment, dear wife,

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:57.730
I am happy to join in.

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:02.310
In any case, I am handsome and rich, 
so let us waste money together, dear wife!

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:05.430
<i><i>That's totally not what I'm doing!</i></i>

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:09.070
I fear my dear wife is too tired to serve me.

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:13.470
You must... take care of yourself.

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:16.330
You needn't worry about me.

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:18.810
If there is nothing else, I'm going.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:22.140
There is something.

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:24.740
Out with it, then.

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:26.660
I will be working late tonight.

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:28.560
You will have dinner with me first,

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:30.230
then prepare my ink.

00:08:30.930 --> 00:08:32.840
<i><i>Dammit.</i></i>

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:36.800
<i><i>This dinner is great!</i></i>

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:50.860
This is such a delicious meal.
 Aren't you eating?

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:52.770
I am fine watching you eat.

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.340
Wh-Why are you watching me eat?

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:18.190
What are you doing?

00:09:18.690 --> 00:09:19.810
A grain of rice.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:21.630
Rice?

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:25.500
Couldn't you just tell me? 
I can wipe it off myself!

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:28.310
Fine.

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:31.170
<i><i>Being cooperative now?</i></i>

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:40.810
<i><i>I want to pour this ink all over his head.</i></i>

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:44.200
Your Highness, the ink has been prepared.

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.740
Can I leave now?

00:09:46.470 --> 00:09:47.810
Have a seat.

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:50.310
I will be busy for a while.

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:53.190
What do you mean, "have a seat"?

00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:56.560
Just sit quietly. There is no 
need for you to do anything.

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:59.140
Do I need to teach you how to, dear wife?

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:02.810
No, I'm fine.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.810
<i><i>You're such a jerk, Prince Ye-diot.</i></i>

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:39.930
How sweet...

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:01.900
What a rude woman...

00:11:59.310 --> 00:12:02.430
Sesame, be quiet... it's time to sleep...

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:06.040
Mochi.

00:12:07.140 --> 00:12:09.560
<i><i>She even eats in her dreams?</i></i>

00:12:09.970 --> 00:12:11.990
<i><i>What a gluttonous woman.</i></i>

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:30.400
<i><i>Did I fall asleep?</i></i>

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:37.150
<i><i>Why is Prince Jerk here?!</i></i>

00:12:38.930 --> 00:12:40.810
Why am I on your bed?

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:44.510
Would you rather be under the sheets?

00:12:47.770 --> 00:12:48.500
Do not move—

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:57.450
Qian Yunxi, hold it right there!

00:12:57.450 --> 00:12:59.330
Like <i>hell </i>I'm going to!

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:00.060
Qian Yunxi!

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:14.220
Wait... Why am I running?

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:18.880
I didn't even ask him what he did to me. Damn.

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:23.840
Who's there?

00:13:27.310 --> 00:13:30.370
You can actually see me, woman?

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:32.650
A demon?

00:13:34.470 --> 00:13:35.900
You shouldn't be here.

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:38.660
Leave right now, or I won't hold back!

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:41.370
You sure do talk big.

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:45.680
I suggest you do what you're told 
and leave or you'll get hurt.

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:47.420
Don't make me laugh.

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:50.080
You're just a human being.
You think you can hurt <i>me</i>?

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:57.310
Who interfered with me?

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:00.020
<i>This is...</i>

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:02.140
Did you not see those stones?

00:14:02.560 --> 00:14:04.270
Why were you standing there in a daze?

00:14:05.180 --> 00:14:06.930
Did you not know you were in danger?

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:09.640
Do not argue and stay by my side
 so I can protect you.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:12.720
Who is attacking from the shadows?

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:14.300
Come out!

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:17.290
<i>It seems he doesn't know who he </i>really<i> is.</i>

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:19.180
<i>I'll get such a reward for this one!</i>

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:25.060
It is dangerous! Come back here!

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:26.850
You can't handle this!

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:28.850
Get out of here. You'll only hold me back.

00:14:28.850 --> 00:14:29.600
Behind you!

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:39.020
Are you all right?

00:14:41.140 --> 00:14:44.020
Why did you block it for me? There was no need!

00:14:45.140 --> 00:14:46.360
Because...

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:49.520
You are my princess.

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:54.560
Curses... Who is doing this?

00:14:56.890 --> 00:14:59.020
Leave the rest to me. Just run.

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:03.020
Prince Charming saved 
his Beauty. It's so touching.

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:06.220
Let me send you to hell together!

00:15:08.270 --> 00:15:08.770
Disperse!

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:22.520
Impossible! This woman actually 
dispersed my demonic energy?

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:24.520
Damn demon!

00:15:25.430 --> 00:15:27.370
In the name of justice, I will destroy you!

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:30.830
<i>What in the world is out there?</i>

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:32.480
<i>Curses...</i>

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:35.130
You can't hit me!

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:37.890
Who said I wanted to hit <i>you</i>?

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:42.570
Watch out!

00:15:57.920 --> 00:15:58.490
Come.
